# Multi-Tenant-E-Commerce-SaaS-platform
A comprehensive Multi-Tenant E-Commerce Platform designed to allow independent vendors to register, set up their own digital storefronts, and manage inventory within a single unified ecosystem.


Step 1: Create the main folder

Open VS Code → Terminal → New Terminal and run:
mkdir multi-tenant-ecommerce
cd multi-tenant-ecommerce

Create the frontend:
npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react

Choose:React
JavaScript

Then install frontend packages:
cd frontend
npm install
npm install react-router-dom @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux axios
cd ..

Step 2: Create the backend
mkdir backend
cd backend
npm init -y

Install the backend dependencies:
npm install express mongoose cors dotenv bcryptjs jsonwebtoken helmet
npm install cloudinary multer nodemailer stripe
npm install

Install development dependency:
npm install --save-dev nodemon

